	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Cytokine Stimulation of PTPN2-deleted cancer cells</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">PTPN2 was deleted from a selection of murine and human cancer cells using CRISPR/Cas9. The loss-of-function phenotype was assessed in vitro with cytokine stimulation or vehicle control.</Item>
